  "name": "KPL SAB 赛制 / KPL SAB League Format",
  "author": "L-ku",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "contains_code": true,
  "description": "把中国赛区改成 KPL 的 S/A/B 分组赛制：每轮积分清零并按名次重新分组、S/A/B 各 3 个单循环（45 场）、赛季末统一 12 队双败 BO7 季后赛（16 场）+ 7-10 名排位赛、推送官方最终名次与对阵新闻、修正国际杯抽签里的挂名队和不重复席位。1.2.0 起每个赛段开始（春季赛开档、夏季赛 6/22 转会期开启）先随机抽签分成三组并推送抽签新闻；第一轮显示为「KPL 一组/二组/三组」，第二轮起才显示「KPL S组/A组/B组」，季后赛统一显示「KPL 季后赛」。命名只改显示层，不动联赛 ID、赛区和积分。1.1.0 起中国赛区（含 K 甲、青训队和所有新生成的选手）统一使用 KPL 风格中文名，能力值不变。1.2.2 起 S组/A组/B组为同一联赛级别（A 组不再被引擎视为二级联赛），不会再有 S↔A 升降级赛、降级履历和赞助层级惩罚；B↔K甲 升降级保留。1.3.0 起新增「季后赛」按钮：底部栏展开一个照原版对阵卡样式排版的完整 16 场赛程面板（轮次、日期时刻、队徽、队名、实时比分），原生联赛页/日历只有 8 个卡位、只能显示一半的问题由此绕过；同时把开赛新闻升级为完整 16 场对阵表，并在每个季后赛日结束后推送当日两场战报。建议与 KPL + Real LoL Teams 数据包一起使用。\n\nKPL (King Pro League) S/A/B format for the CN region: per-round standings reset and regrouping, three single round-robins per group (45 matches), a unified 12-team double-elimination BO7 playoff with 7-10 placement matches, official final-rank news, and international-cup seat fixes. As of 1.2.0 each split starts with a random draw into three groups (at save start for Spring, at the 6/22 transfer-window opening for Summer) with a news push; round 1 is labelled \"KPL Group 1/2/3\", rounds 2-3 use \"KPL S/A/B\", and playoffs always show \"KPL Playoffs\". Naming is display-only and never touches league ids, regions or standings. As of 1.1.0 every athlete in the CN region — including the second division, academy teams and newly generated players — gets a KPL-style Chinese name without changing any stats. As of 1.2.2 the S, A and B groups share one league tier (A is no longer a second division), so the engine no longer runs S-to-A promotion/relegation, relegation history tags or tier-based sponsor penalties; B-to-K甲 promotion is kept. As of 1.3.0 a \"Playoffs\" button opens a full 16-match bracket panel built from the game's own matchup-card layout (round, date/time, logos, names, live scores), working around the native league page and calendar only having 8 playoff slots; the bracket news now lists all 16 matches and a daily report news is pushed after each playoff day. Best used together with the KPL + Real LoL Teams data mod.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-19",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.6.0"
    }
  ]
}